            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Spray"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Pollen, it becomes temporarily immune for 24 hours.\n\nSuccess: The creature is unaffected.\nFailure: The creature is fascinated. For as long as it is fascinated, it must spend each of its actions to move closer to the yellow musk creeper as expediently as possible, while avoiding obvious dangers. If the creature is adjacent to the yellow musk creeper, it stays still and doesn't act.\nCritical Failure: As failure, but the condition doesn't end automatically. The creature can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns. On a success, the fascinated condition and other effects end."
            },
